From 9d2f4470195363093d2e446e4864e02563ca3570 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port <port@local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:01:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add the vendor prefixes
 in use

O device tree do board topaz usa prefixos de propriedade que nao estavam
em vendor-prefixes.yaml, e o dt-validate rejeita cada propriedade com
prefixo desconhecido: bat (fuel gauge vendor), synaptics (touchscreen),
fpc (fingerprint), fsm, mi/nopmi (Xiaomi), pd, sc, si, sm, touch, vib,
gpio-key, rt-tcpc e rt1711pd (Richtek), tcpc-dual, typec, ln8000_charger,
pin_assignment e signal.
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml  | 54 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 54 insertions(+)

